title: After the Assassination
subtitle: The President has been killed; PPS decides how its organisations answer.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
face-image: img/polish/polish_event_assassination_response.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_politics_rules && PolishPolitics.responseDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event presidency.assassination_response, B4 (technical reference 17.6, 17.5, 15.2, 13.4; card catalogue 9.5;
// decision 2B of stage 7): only after a confirmed death and the vacancy filled by the Marshal; one decision, 0 T; the
// costs of the chosen tool in R. The gathering is tested for a clash by 17.5; only executed unlawful violence
// records a case against the PPS organisations.
PolishPolitics.responseView(Q);
var current = Q.polish_presidency ? Q.polish_presidency.current : null;
Q.pl_b4_acting = current && current.status === 'acting' ? current.holder_name : '';
!}

= After the assassination of Gabriel Narutowicz

[? if pl_b4_acting : [+ pl_b4_acting +], Marshal of the Sejm, substitutes for the President until the National Assembly elects a successor. ?]

PPS must defend the constitutional order and keep grief and anger from turning into revenge.

- @defend
- @restraint
- @retaliation

@defend
title: A mass defence of the republic
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Our press and unions call people to a peaceful gathering in defence of the Republic, which strengthens democracy (+2).
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.responseStatus(Q, 'defend').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b4_defend_why +]
go-to: protection

@restraint
title: Restraint and a focus on the lawful succession
subtitle: No cost. We speak in the National Assembly without calling people into the streets; those who expected a mass protest may be disappointed.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.responseStatus(Q, 'restraint').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b4_restraint_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.responseChoose(Q, 'restraint');
!}
go-to: result

@retaliation
title: Allow our Milicja a retaliatory confrontation
subtitle: Cost: half a resource. The Centrum of the party protests (+8), and if it comes to a fight, the authorities will turn against our organisations.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.responseStatus(Q, 'retaliation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b4_retaliation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.responseChoose(Q, 'retaliation');
!}
go-to: result

@protection
new-page: true

= Protecting the gathering

Our Milicja can guard the gathering for half a resource more. It makes a clash less likely, though not impossible.

- @unprotected
- @protected
- @polish_event_assassination_response: Back to the answers.

@unprotected
title: Hold the gathering without the Milicja
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.responseChoose(Q, 'defend', {protect: false});
!}
go-to: result

@protected
title: Protect the gathering with the Milicja
subtitle: Cost: half a resource more.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.responseStatus(Q, 'defend', true).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b4_protect_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.responseChoose(Q, 'defend', {protect: true});
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= After the assassination of President Narutowicz

[+ pl_b4_result +]

- @root: Continue.
